# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
# Server-only: read by the staff agent routes, never sent to the browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# The morning paper (lib/paper/model.ts). A Gemini API key from Google AI Studio (it starts with "AIza"). Without it,
# Claude writes the paper. GEMINI_MODEL is optional; the default is gemini-2.5-flash.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=
